## 9. ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES

Based on `.env.example` and code analysis: `DATABASE_URL` (PostgreSQL connection string), `NEXTAUTH_URL` (site URL), `NEXTAUTH_SECRET` (JWT secret), `RESEND_API_KEY` (email sending), `EMAIL_FROM` (sender address, default "Expert Guru <noreply@expertguru.net>"), `CCAVENUE_MERCHANT_ID`, `CCAVENUE_ACCESS_CODE`, `CCAVENUE_WORKING_KEY`, `PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID`, `PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET`, `PAYPAL_MODE` ("sandbox" or "live").

